{"html_text": {"ja368:0.1": "<article id='ja368'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja368:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja368:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja368:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja368:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja368:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja368:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja368:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja368:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja368:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja368:6.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja368:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja368:0.2": "Pañcakanipāta ", "ja368:0.3": "Vaṇṇārohavagga ", "ja368:0.4": "8. Tacasārajātaka ", "ja368:1.1": "“Amittahatthatthagatā, ", "ja368:1.2": "tacasārasamappitā; ", "ja368:1.3": "Pasannamukhavaṇṇāttha, ", "ja368:1.4": "kasmā tumhe na socatha”. ", "ja368:2.1": "“Na socanāya paridevanāya, ", "ja368:2.2": "Atthova labbho api appakopi; ", "ja368:2.3": "Socantamenaṁ dukhitaṁ viditvā, ", "ja368:2.4": "Paccatthikā attamanā bhavanti. ", "ja368:3.1": "Yato ca kho paṇḍito āpadāsu, ", "ja368:3.2": "Na vedhatī atthavinicchayaññū; ", "ja368:3.3": "Paccatthikāssa dukhitā bhavanti, ", "ja368:3.4": "Disvā mukhaṁ avikāraṁ purāṇaṁ. ", "ja368:4.1": "Jappena mantena subhāsitena, ", "ja368:4.2": "Anuppadānena paveṇiyā vā; ", "ja368:4.3": "Yathā yathā yattha labhetha atthaṁ, ", "ja368:4.4": "Tathā tathā tattha parakkameyya. ", "ja368:5.1": "Yato ca jāneyya alabbhaneyyo, ", "ja368:5.2": "Mayā va aññena vā esa attho; ", "ja368:5.3": "Asocamāno adhivāsayeyya, ", "ja368:5.4": "Kammaṁ daḷhaṁ kinti karomi dānī”ti. ", "ja368:6.1": "Tacasārajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja368:0.1": "", "ja368:0.2": "", "ja368:0.3": "", "ja368:0.4": "", "ja368:1.1": "Amittahatthatthagatā → … hatthattagatā (katthaci, bj -nissya) ", "ja368:1.2": "", "ja368:1.3": "", "ja368:1.4": "", "ja368:2.1": "", "ja368:2.2": "Atthova labbho → attho ca labbhā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); atthodha labbhā (an5.48:1 [48. Alabbhanīyaṭhānasutta]) ", "ja368:2.3": "", "ja368:2.4": "", "ja368:3.1": "", "ja368:3.2": "", "ja368:3.3": "Paccatthikāssa → paccatthikā te (mr) ", "ja368:3.4": "", "ja368:4.1": "", "ja368:4.2": "", "ja368:4.3": "", "ja368:4.4": "", "ja368:5.1": "", "ja368:5.2": "Mayā va → mayā vā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja368:5.3": "", "ja368:5.4": "", "ja368:6.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja368:0.1": "", "ja368:0.2": "", "ja368:0.3": "", "ja368:0.4": "", "ja368:1.1": "ms22J_1259, msdiv95, pts-vp-pli3.204", "ja368:1.2": "", "ja368:1.3": "", "ja368:1.4": "", "ja368:2.1": "ms22J_1260, msdiv96, vri68.111", "ja368:2.2": "", "ja368:2.3": "", "ja368:2.4": "", "ja368:3.1": "dr27.179, ms22J_1261, msdiv97, pts-vp-pli3.205", "ja368:3.2": "", "ja368:3.3": "", "ja368:3.4": "", "ja368:4.1": "ms22J_1262, msdiv98, sya27.180", "ja368:4.2": "", "ja368:4.3": "", "ja368:4.4": "", "ja368:5.1": "csp1ed22.132, csp2ed22.132, ms22J_1263, msdiv99, ndp22.123", "ja368:5.2": "", "ja368:5.3": "", "ja368:5.4": "", "ja368:6.1": "ms22J_1264"}, "keys_order": ["ja368:0.1", "ja368:0.2", "ja368:0.3", "ja368:0.4", "ja368:1.1", "ja368:1.2", "ja368:1.3", "ja368:1.4", "ja368:2.1", "ja368:2.2", "ja368:2.3", "ja368:2.4", "ja368:3.1", "ja368:3.2", "ja